A lesson from pet strategy in the source code - When a pet gets
down to half of its hit points it retreats from combat to heal.
Given that few monsters actively attack pets and only hit them
in defensive swings pets can be more aggressive than players.
But leaving combat with half hit points still gets pets killed
left and right.

It doesn't matter if it's a grid bug.  If you're at half of your
max hit points it is time to flee towards the up stairs to rest
and heal.

